                  Eight people lost their lives in the attack. The tragedy
                  shook the nation to its foundations and remains one of the
                  most painful moments in the history of independent Armenia.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </Reveal>

        <Reveal delay={100}>
          <div className="mx-auto mt-14 max-w-4xl text-center">
            <h3 className="font-display text-sm tracking-[0.3em] text-[#B3000F]">
              IN MEMORY OF THOSE WHO FELL
            </h3>
            <ul className="mt-6 grid gap-x-8 gap-y-3 font-serif text-lg text-[#0B1F4B] sm:grid-cols-2">
              {VICTIMS.map((v) => (
                <li key={v} className="flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
                  <span className="h-1 w-1 rotate-45 bg-[#D90012]" />
                  {v}
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        </Reveal>

        <div className="mt-20">
          <Ornament />
        </div>

        {/* Honours */}
        <div className="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
          {HONOURS.map((h, i) => (
            <Reveal key={h.title} delay={i * 120}>
              <article className="group relative h-full border border-[#0B1F4B]/10 bg-white p-7 transition duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_20px_50px_-25px_rgba(11,31,75,0.5)]">
                <span
                  className="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-1"
                  style={{ background: [FLAG.red, FLAG.blue, FLAG.apricot, FLAG.red][i] }}
                />
                <EternitySign size={30} color={FLAG.blue} className="mb-5 opacity-80" />
                <h4 className="font-serif text-2xl leading-tight text-[#0B1F4B]">{h.title}</h4>
                <p className="mt-3 font-sans text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600">{h.text}</p>
              </article>
            </Reveal>
          ))}
        </div>

        {/* Cultural impact */}
        <Reveal delay={100}>
          <div className="mx-auto mt-24 max-w-3xl text-center">
            <h3 className="font-display text-3xl text-[#0B1F4B] sm:text-4xl">
              The Sparapet of a Generation
            </h3>
            <p className="mt-6 font-sans text-[17px] leading-8 text-slate-700">
              For many Armenians, Vazgen Sargsyan embodies the generation that
              defended the land and built the state in the hardest of times.
              The ancient title <em>Sparapet</em> — the commander-in-chief of
              Armenia’s historic armies — is given to him by popular memory.
              Each year on 5 March and 27 October, people gather at Yerablur and
              at his memorials to lay flowers. Songs, books, documentaries and
              monuments continue to honour him, and his name remains a byword
              for devotion to the homeland and to the soldiers who serve it.
            </p>
          </div>
        </Reveal>
      </div>
    </section>
  );
}

